''
'' Tandy TRS-80 Color Computer Extended Color BASIC PLAY example.
''
'' The source scan's OCR renders the octave command letter O as zero in a few
'' places.  This file uses O3 and O2, matching the manual text that describes
'' selecting octave 3 and returning to octave 2.
''
'' Source:
''   https://colorcomputerarchive.com/repo/Documents/Manuals/Hardware/Getting%20Started%20With%20Extended%20Color%20Basic%20%28Tandy%29.pdf
''

#lang "qb"

PLAY "CDEFG;O3;ABAO2;FEDCBA"

'' end of play_octaves.bas
